     "body": "<p>Hey <a href=\"https://shopview.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A2713e405-8836-4dee-8802-255f15740bbe\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"712020:2713e405-8836-4dee-8802-255f15740bbe\" data-account-id=\"712020:2713e405-8836-4dee-8802-255f15740bbe\" accountid=\"712020:2713e405-8836-4dee-8802-255f15740bbe\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Dusan Radulovic</a> Add clear filters at the end of the filters bar.</p>",
